  "description": "Listed Building Consent to seek amendments to the scheme approved under  LBS reg no 17/AP/3071 for alterations to enable a change of use of Beltwood House (a Grade II listed building) from a Class C2 residential institution to provide 7 apartments and alterations and extension of the existing Gate Lodge. Works proposed to the main house include: reduction in the number of apartments from 7 to 6  (consolidating Units 02 and 05) and alterations to the internal layout.  Works proposed to the gate house include: introduction of 2 conservation rooflights to rear extension, internal alterations and replacement of modern door with new door, sidelights and canopy.\r",
